   "building_id": "B60_balance",
   "sector_id": "S03_market",
   "alt": "The loft seen from a high balcony: a green arched door in a cream-stone wall on the left, grain sacks heaped on the right, and under a glass roof on dark-green iron arches a round wooden stage full of goings-on. A camel in a royal sash sniffs and kicks up dust, a cook holds up a towering soufflé, a little man on stilts carries a sheaf of oats, a balance sinks under a cake while a lone carrot rises, the wind whips a hanging basket and flings its apples, a man slices a cucumber very finely, a fat cat beams beside a fish skeleton on a plate, a magician's balance tips under one feather, a walrus pushes a dial needle round and a man pours water into two glasses. An apple crate stands by the balcony rail.",
